# HH-031 Phase 1 — exclude task briefs from DEFAULT ripgrep/grep content search.
# Briefs stay git-tracked and openable by explicit path (rg searches a file given
# explicitly on the command line even when ignored). Primary retrieval is the
# knowledge.yaml note ledger (HH-016); briefs are an on-demand audit log opened by
# task-id, not full-text-grepped on every search. This is search hygiene, NOT a
# delete (git-conventions.md:106 — hard delete is human-gated; nothing is removed).
TASK-*.md
